ng inside the fixture value. When a test fails, pytest renders the fixture argument and can print ambient credential values into local or CI logs. This was directly observed during a deliberate defect-seeded RED run; no credential value is recorded on this ticket. The performance ticket must not absorb an unrelated security fix.\n\n## Plan\n- Reproduce with a synthetic sentinel secret in the ambient environment and a deliberate assertion failure.\n- Change the fixture boundary to pass only required environment variables or use a representation-safe wrapper while preserving the real bash subprocess environment needed by the tests.\n- Audit sibling subprocess fixtures for the same dict(os.environ)-inside-rendered-fixture shape.\n- Prove the synthetic sentinel never appears in pytest failure output while the autodeploy suite remains behaviorally green.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A deterministic regression test fails before the fix because a synthetic ambient secret appears in captured pytest failure rendering.\n- [ ] The synthetic secret is absent from failure output after the fix.\n- [ ] Required PATH and autodeploy environment behavior remains covered through the real bash subprocess.\n- [ ] Sibling occurrences are inventoried and either fixed or linked as follow-ups.\n- [ ] Repository gates and Gerrit votes pass before closure.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["security","tests"],"ticket_id":"fc43-3c50-ec6c-4a3e","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Prevent autodeploy test failures from printing ambient credentials","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bc2248b3-3720-407f-a567-e3364b15e7fa","6890ce29-b2e6-4fd8-b89f-453230facb19"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786838727660428135,"uuid":"0a523874-8c2e-4a9c-9877-ae9996f6bbb9"}